# MLX resolves its metallib by the RELATIVE path "default.metallib" against
# the process CWD (METAL_PATH in device.cpp -> load_library_from_path), and
# `swift test` runs from the package root, so the library is not found without
# this link. Created by scripts/setup.sh; never committed.
default.metallib
